Group: ISO Accelerator Pack
Collection: IAP_v1.3
Usage Guideline: IAP_v1.3_admi.004.001.02_SystemEventNotification_Broadcast
Base Message: admi.004.001.02
Date of publication: 08 August 2025
URL: https://www2.swift.com/mystandards/#/mp/mx/_oPZKcBbmEfC8sewLGD78qA/_oQxrLBbmEfC8sewLGD78qA
Description: Scope
The SystemEventNotification message is sent by a central system to notify the occurrence of an event in a central system.
Usage
The message can be used by a central settlement system to inform its participants of an event that is going to occur in the system, for instance that the system will be down at a certain time, etc.

This messages can be sent form AND to any users registered into the CUG and may also be distributed to several Participants of the Mi Service via the InterAct distribution list feature.
